          "body": "Every card deck is unique. That’s why we offer complete customization options. It's your box, so the design should be yours too. Choose custom sizes, box styles, premium finishes, window cut-outs, and logo printing- anything you want to add to your brand’s playing card holder box.\n\n\n",
