          "text": "Most cookie tube packaging is made from paperboard layers that provide strength and durability. Options include kraft paper, paperboard, or cardboard for durable and eco-friendly cookie packaging and laminated finishes for added protection and strength. These materials help maintain product quality while supporting sustainable packaging goals of modern brands in 2026.\n",
