          "text": "The most common and famous packaging style for pre-rolls and cannabis blunts is custom paper tube packaging. It became widely popular in the US market because it protects pre rolls from bending or crushing during transportation. It also creates a cleaner and more premium presentation compared to traditional soft packaging. This simple structural upgrade made the pre-rolls look far better than before and significantly improved both product protection and customer experience. Whether for individual pre-roll packaging or retail blunt packaging, [HOF Pack](https://hofpack.com/) is the trusted packaging manufacturer in the US that can customize it all for you. ",
