      "article_sections": [
        {
          "text": "Custom Pantyhose Packaging",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Custom Pantyhose packaging is the modern way to style traditional hosiery. Invented in the 1950s, they were designed as a convenient alternative to traditional stockings. Wearing thigh-high nylon stockings attached to cumbersome garter belts and tight girdles was necessary for all women before that. They were highly uncomfortable for women, so hosiery was invented by combining stockings with panties. To revive that culture and design, brands now sell pantyhose (inspired by 1960s hosiery). Custom pantyhose packaging means packing pantyhose in premium, retail-ready boxes to protect the fabric from any damage and for product presentation. \n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "level": "divider"
        },
        {
          "text": "Premium Hosiery Display For Retail and Gift Boxes",
          "level": "h3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Premium hosiery packages are used as both retail-ready products to display on counter shelves or hang tabs, and as specialized gift boxes to create a luxury unboxing experience. \n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Anatomy of a Snag-Free Pantyhose Package",
          "level": "h4"
        },
        {
          "text": "A snag-free pantyhose package is designed to protect your nylon-made hosiery products. They are made of premium materials with silk lining and radiused inner folding cards for non-sharp corners so the hosiery can be wrapped flat without puncturing or pulling threads. \n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Retail-Ready Mechanics: Hang Tabs vs. Counter Displays",
          "level": "h4"
        },
        {
          "text": "Custom pantyhose packaging accommodates different retail environments. For retail displays, your custom pantyhose packages are either displayed on counter shelves or hung in busy retail environments for enhanced visibility. We offer the integration of butterfly hang-hole punches for pegboard displays and cardboard, heavy-weight, auto-locking bottom cartons designed for standalone boutique countertop trays.\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Historical Hosiery Envelopes vs. Modern Rigid Boxes",
          "level": "h4"
        },
        {
          "text": "Traditional packaging pantyhose relied on slim, flat pillow pouches and geometric cardstock envelopes. However, in modern times, luxury lines have opted for deep two-piece slider rigid boxes with custom ribbon pulls to create a luxury experience for customers. \n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "level": "divider"
        },
        {
          "text": "Replicating Classic Elegance with Vintage Pantyhose Packaging\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "At HOF Pack, we try to replicate the retro authenticity with our material selection. We use kraft, paperboard, and cardstock materials to create vintage pantyhose packages. We aim to revive the finishes that mimic the 1960s and 70s look, but retaining the modern, luxury appeal.  For material selection, here are two design ideas from which you can choose:\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "- Modern high-gloss plastic windows with old-school, biodegradable glassine paper windows. \n- Uncoated, recycled folding boxboard provides that authentic tactile matte texture. \n- Luxury two-piece [rigid box with magnetic closure](https://hofpack.com/product/magnetic-closure-boxes) or ribbon closures for premium retail-ready appeal for your custom retail boxes and pantyhose packaging.",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Contact Us Now For Fast Turnaround",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": " Contact our team at info@hofpack.com or call +1 (888) 429-4881 for a free consultation.\n",
          "level": "p"
        }
      ]
