          "alt": "",
          "body": "Turn a plain liner into branding with custom greaseproof paper. Add your logo, pattern, or colors to sheets and cupcake wraps that face the customer with every order. Start with a free 3D mockup, approve the look, and receive your order in 8–12 days with a dedicated project manager on your side.\n",
