      "article_sections": [
        {
          "text": "The Sheet Every Serious Bakery Runs On\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ask any pastry chef what they reach for first and the answer is greaseproof baking paper. It lines sheet pans, wraps proofing dough, separates frozen patties, and rolls out sticky fillings without a fight. \nOne roll replaces parchment, pan spray, and half your cleanup, which is exactly why 5,000+ brands trust it. Trusted quality, FSC-certified stock, and an A+ BBB rating mean every batch behaves the same, from your first tray of the morning to your last order of the night.\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Why Bakers Love Greaseproof Paper Cupcake Liners\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "A great cupcake deserves a wrapper that shows it off. Greaseproof paper cupcake liners resist oil bleed-through, so the sides stay clean, colorful, and grab-worthy in the display case. \nNo greasy translucent patches, no peeling, no dull prints, just cupcakes that look as fresh as they are. Your bakery needs grease proof paper cake liners that protect and keep everything clean. \nFor bakeries selling on presentation, that clean-sided finish is the difference between a glance and a sale. Pair them with custom greaseproof paper printing and every liner works double duty as edible-adjacent branding.\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Not All Paper Is Greaseproof Enough\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Shoppers often assume any liner will do, but paper greaseproof enough for heavy frying is a different animal than a light bakery sheet. Fryer baskets, burger builds, and oily bakes need real grease resistance, while delicate pastries want a lighter touch. \nOur team matches the right greaseproof paper to your menu, weight, and heat needs, so you never over-buy or fight a sheet that soaks through. Order exactly what your kitchen runs on, with no guesswork and no wasted budget.\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bring the Bakery-Grade Wrap Home With HOF Pack\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "[HOF Pack](https://hofpack.com/) makes custom greaseproof paper simple, from free 3D mockup to doorstep delivery. Enjoy full custom printing, a 4.9/5 trust score, a 100-unit minimum, and free US shipping, with a dedicated project manager guiding every step. \nReady to bake cleaner and brand smarter? \nCall +1 (888) 429-4881 or message us on WhatsApp at +1 (520) 427-1110 to get started today.\n",
          "level": "p"
        }
      ]
