          "alt": "",
          "body": "Many brands are moving toward paper-based packaging. Cardboard is durable, recyclable, and easy to print on. It also gives products a clean and premium look without adding unnecessary weight. And it keeps your product protected from any handling pressures. Whether you’re launching a new stationery collection or updating your packaging, cardboard offers a simple and cost-effective solution.\n",
