          "alt": "",
          "body": "A shoe box does more than hold a pair of shoes. It protects your product during shipping, keeps shoes organized in storage, and gives customers a great first impression when they open the box.\nMany brands also use their shoe boxes to tell their story. A logo, brand colors, or a simple message inside the lid can make your packaging more memorable.\n",
