          "body": "Give customers packaging that sells your shop. Add your logo, colors, or brand name to custom-printed freezer paper. Let us turn every wrapped cut into a walking advertisement. Start with a free 3D mockup, approve the look, and receive your order in 8–12 days with a dedicated project manager on hand.\n",
