          "text": "A bracelet packaging is not similar to wrapping a ring or a pair of earrings. It is much more than that. A bracelet is longer, and it moves more. So, it needs packaging that not only secure the item inside but also attractive enough to be shared in Instagram and other social platforms by the customers. HOF Pack makes boxes that  do triple jobs. It protects the  bracelet, presents it well, and survives transit and shipping.\n",
