          "text": "[HOF Pack](https://hofpack.com/) produces jewelry bracelet box lines around your bracelets. We do not provide you just a box, but a system. You can start with material of your choice: \n- Kraft board for a clean, sustainable look. \n- Rigid board when the box itself should feel like part of the gift. \n- Velvet-wrapped for a luxury bracelet gift box that matches the price tag. \nWe also build antique luxury bracelet gift box styles for vintage or heirloom collections — aged textures, brass-tone hardware, the works.\n",
