          "alt": "",
          "body": "Every product is different. That’s why we make cardboard tubes for packaging in custom sizes, colors, and styles. Whether you need simple kraft tubes or luxury printed packaging, we’ll help you build packaging that fits your product perfectly.\n",
          "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dazm20bju/image/upload/v1785267897/5b92e140-a055-4125-bdad-396bd9633c62.jpg",
