          "text": "Your packaging can't slow you down when the lunch rush hits. Hot paper for burgers and sandwiches wraps fast, folds clean, and holds heat through every order, so nothing arrives cold or falling apart. \nThe sturdy, grease-tight sheet keeps saucy builds contained and buns fresh from grill to guest. Whether you run a burger joint, a food truck, or a busy deli counter, these hot paper wraps keep your service sharp and your food looking exactly as good as it tastes.\n",
          "level": "p"
