          "text": "HoF Pack turns every takeout bag into a visual advertisement for your restaurant. Our bags are designed to showcase your logo in sharp, and vibrant detail. Our custom paper gives every meal a distinct, professional presentation your customers will remember. Stand out from competitors and build brand loyalty with HoF Pack. \nContact us at +1 (888) 429-4881 or text our WhatsApp at +1 (520) 427-1110 to get started.\n",
