          "text": "Corrugated is a liner board used precisely for large-format shipping boxes. We make premium quality corrugated full sheet cake boxes to hold sheet cakes, tiered cakes, and bulk bakery orders for commercial distribution. These boxes are a staple for the following industries:\n- Commercial Bakeries\n- Custom Cake Studios\n- Catering Companies \n- Wholesale Bakeries\n- Food Service Distributors\n",
