          "body": "When holiday orders start rolling in fast, you cannot afford to waste time building specialized boxes or complicated designs. Gable gift boxes feature a smart, one-piece pop-up design that snaps into place in just a few seconds. They require zero tape, glue, or staples to assemble. This allows your team to pack holiday bundles quickly, keep lines moving, and deliver a beautiful presentation to your customers. You can also customize the gable boxes based on your brand guide, personal preferences, or seasonal touches to make it stand out.",
