          "body": "Exceptional food packaging starts with superior materials.[ HOF Pack](https://hofpack.com/)’s food-grade butter paper is crafted from high-grade, greaseproof stock designed to handle butter, ghee, heavy oils, and moisture without weakening. Beyond its robust protection, our smooth surface provides a clean canvas for your logo and brand colors. Don't let plain wrap go to waste—turn every pastry box, cheese wrap, and deli order into a reflection of your brand's quality.\n",
