      "article_sections": [
        {
          "text": "Essential Versatility That Protects Products and Drives Repeat Sales\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Top food brands and artisan makers don’t settle for average packaging. Custom butter paper is an essential, multi-use asset that protects product quality while constantly marketing your brand. Elevate your customer presentation, protect your profit margins, and streamline kitchen operations across countless applications:\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "- Gourmet Dairy & Cheese: Easily wrap butter, ghee, and artisan cheeses without moisture loss.\n- Bakery & Confectionery: Keep flaky croissants, fresh cookies, and delicate chocolates pristine and non-stick.\n- Deli & Fast Casual: Line trays, wrap signature burgers, or interleave sliced meats and frozen portions.\n- Artisan Goods: Give handmade soaps, candles, and specialty retail goods a premium, handcrafted unboxing feel.\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Why Top Food Brands Trust Our Custom Butter Paper\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Printed butter paper offers a low-cost, high-impact way to promote your brand. HOF Pack produces premium, greaseproof paper that contains oils while putting your logo front and center. It protects food, allows clean release, and provides a plastic-free, eco-friendly alternative to foil—serving your customers cleanly while marketing your business. ",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "A Variety of Sizes Available for Butter Paper \n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Butter paper is sized around the food and the format it serves, so the sheet fits the wrap, box, or pan without waste. We produce every standard US size, then build custom cuts on top. Common formats include:\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "- Wrapping and interleaving sheets:\nSmall sheets for single servings and light items\nMid-size all-purpose wraps for everyday use\nLarge sheets for subs, shareables, and bigger portions\n- Interfolded pop-up sheets:\nDispenser-ready sheets in the foodservice \"10¾-inch\" family, from compact to full-width\n- Pan liners and continuous rolls:\nQuarter-sheet, half-sheet, and full-sheet pan liners for bakery trays\nRolls in standard dispenser widths\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Common Formats and Configurations\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Size is what the sheet measures. Format is how it reaches your line. We deliver butter paper the way your kitchen runs:\n- Flat pre-cut sheets in bulk stacks\n- Interfolded, pop-up sheets that dispense one at a time\n- Continuous rolls for wrapping and lining\n- Bulk case counts and custom pack sizes for multi-location brands\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Colored and Printed Butter Paper\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "A branded sheet does more than protect food, it carries your name. We print sharp, food-safe graphics and offer stocks tinted to your palette:\n- Printed butter paper with your logo, pattern, or full-color artwork\n- Colored butter paper in brand tones for an instant premium look\n- Food-safe soy-based and water-based inks\n- CMYK full-color and PMS spot-color matching\n- One-color and two-color prints for clean, simple branding\n- Repeating logo or edge-to-edge pattern coverage\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "What Materials and Grades Do We Use?\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "We use food-grade greaseproof paper that resists fats and oils without transferring onto the food. The right grade keeps the barrier strong through wrapping, storage, and display. Our common options include:\n- Standard greaseproof stock for everyday wrapping and lining\n- Heavier greaseproof grades for oily and high-fat products\n- Bright white stock for clean, vivid printing\n- Natural kraft stock for an artisan, earthy look\n- Recyclable, paper-based options for sustainability goals\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Wrap Smarter with  from HOF Pack’s Custom Butter Paper\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "HOF Pack manufactures custom butter paper that combines a reliable grease barrier, clean handling, and branding that puts your name in the customer's hands. From printed sheets and colored stock to pan liners and wholesale butter paper for retail, our team is ready to help. Contact info@hofpack.com or call +1 (888) 429-4881 for a free consultation.\n",
          "level": "p"
        }
      ]
