          "body": "Our air float shipping boxes pair FSC-certified boards with recyclable film. We don’t add foam peanuts or loose fill that creates a mess for your customer upon unboxing. They can enjoy a cleaner unboxing, and a packaging story that supports your sustainability claims.\n",
          "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dazm20bju/image/upload/v1786399290/4211849a-b407-405d-bda2-6154fb5e9803.jpg",
