          "body": "In 2026, nobody wants parcels arriving in bland brown boxes. They want to be creative and sturdy. That's where HOF Pack comes in. We build premium branded colored mailer boxes that sell your brand on the porch, in the hallway, and in the unboxing video — same weight as plain brown, far greater impact.\n",
