          "alt": "cardboard-box-with-clear-window",
          "body": "Upgrading your retail or e-commerce packaging is simple and affordable with HOF Pack. We offer top-quality decorative cardboard boxes with lids at wholesale prices that keep your project well within budget. Whether you need a small cardboard box with lid for delicate jewelry or an extra large cardboard box with lid for bulky retail kits, we have the exact size you need with low minimum orders and fast turnarounds.",
