          "alt": "",
          "body": "People don’t just buy tea. They buy comfort, relaxation, and moments of connection. That’s why packaging plays such an important role. A thoughtfully designed tea gift box creates excitement from the moment it’s received. Whether it’s an afternoon tea gift box for a loved one or a luxury tea gift set for a special occasion, premium packaging just elevates the whole experience and makes it meaningful.\n",
