          "alt": "",
          "body": "Packaging plays a big role in how your product is perceived. Studies show how good packaging elevates your brand image and perceived value. Custom jar candle boxes allow you to present your candles in a neat and professional way. With the right design and printing, your packaging can reflect a premium feel that attracts customers.\n",
