          "alt": "coffee-cup-sleeves",
          "body": "A stylish way of holding your coffee cups is through sleek, branded coffee cup sleeves. Rather than printing the whole coffee cup, you can just add custom-made sleeves for disposable coffee cups. This small detail is an effective way to enhance your product’s look. And it will also increase customer satisfaction since it makes holding a hot coffee cup easy for customers.\n",
