          "body": "We make top quality paper for cheese that prevent premature spoilage and protect your profit margins. Our cheese storage paper slows down unwanted aging and rind deterioration. It maintains the best micro-climates around every cheese wedge. Our paper reduces your waste with a clean inventory management. fragrant, and sellable for days longer than standard wrapping options.\n",
