          "text": "We offer big discounts on bulk order.  Our high-volume custom runs slashes your per-unit packaging costs significantly. You will get a cost-effective, premium wrapping solution that perfectly fits the operational budgets of busy delis, artisan creameries, and large-scale caterers.\n",
