          "body": "Great packaging should look good and perform well as well. Mylar bags are valued for their protective barrier properties and convenient design. Made from PTE and food-grade PE materials, these bags offer reliable packaging and features such as resealable closures, tear notches, and tamper-evident seals. They are practical for both brands and consumers because their lightweight construction helps reduce shipping and storage costs compared to rigid packaging alternatives.\n",
          "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dazm20bju/image/upload/v1780658508/f1b8aed4-b2d3-4c7d-b3a1-d51129127c10.jpg",
