          "alt": "printed custom lenticular stickers",
          "body": "People naturally notice movement, especially if these are interactive designs. That’s why lenticular stickers are so effective, and brands often use them as a marketing technique. With a changing viewing angle, the sticker appears to animate, switch images, or create a 3D effect. This makes them much more engaging, and for brands, that extra attention can make a big difference. ",
