          "alt": "ziplock-mylar-bags",
          "body": "Convenience has become a major part of customer experience. Resealable ziplock closures allow customers to securely close the packaging after every use instead of transferring products into separate containers. This helps products stay fresher while improving overall usability. They are ideal for products that are consumed over time to increase their usability and reduce waste. ",
