          "alt": "kraft-gable-boxes",
          "body": "Sustainable materials do not have to look plain or boring. Custom gable boxes are made with highly attractive kraft paper and tailored directly to your unique brand identity. You can keep the packaging simple with a clean, rustic look of the natural kraft paper, or you can opt for crisp white gable boxes to make high-contrast colors stand out. Whether you want to add a clear view with a gable box with window layout or use full-bleed color printing, customization helps your products shine.",
