          "alt": "",
          "body": "Every broken item is a refund, a reship, and a lost customer. Our double wall corrugated cardboard boxes guarantee fewer crushed cartons, fewer damage claims, and fewer replacements going back out at your cost. Get stronger packaging, which is the cheapest insurance your margins can buy.\n",
