          "text": "Standard rolls waste paper and money because they never quite fit your box. We size around your equipment instead, standard US formats first, then custom cuts on top:\n- Pre-cut wrapping and interleaving sheets for pastries and single servings\n- Interfolded pop-up sheets that dispense one at a time on a busy line\n- Tray and basket liners cut to your exact pans\n- Continuous rolls in standard dispenser widths\nGive us the box, tray, or product, and we cut the sheet to fit, not the other way around.\n",
