          "alt": "",
          "body": "Every load has its own dimensions. We manufacture custom cardboard ammo boxes wholesale to match your exact cartridge diameter, case length, and round count. Choose 20, 25, 50, or 100-round configurations, pick between natural kraft, bright white SBS, or heavier corrugated stock, and add moisture-resistant coatings or premium finishes. Whether you are a reloader running small batches or an ammunition brand scaling into national retail, we build the box and the die-cut tray around your specific round.\n",
