      "article_sections": [
        {
          "text": "What are Gable boxes?\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gable boxes are a one-piece design with a flat base to securely hold the products and taper top with a built-in handle. These boxes are specifically designed for easy carrying and convenient portability. At HOF Pack, we create customized gable boxes with low MOQs and full customization options. Whether you want an open display with a gable box with window layout or need an exact large gable box template to map out your artwork, [HOF Pack ](https://hofpack.com/) has got you covered.\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Uses and Benefits of Large Gable Boxes\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "A large gable box is highly versatile and used across many industries. Whether you need a gable gift box or a [Christmas gable box](https://hofpack.com/product/christmas-gable-boxes), you can customize each box based on your preferences. \n- Catering companies and restaurants use them for family-sized takeout meals because they stay upright and prevent food from spilling. \n- Retailers love large gable boxes for apparel and shoes. \n- They are also the top choice for party planners who need to pack large promotional goodies, toys, or welcome kits for corporate events. \n- Last but not least, large gable boxes are also used as favor boxes for weddings.\n- Ideal to pack jars, heavy retail items, and dense cakes for holiday gift packaging\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Unlimited Customization Options for Large Gable Boxes\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "We give you complete creative freedom over how your packaging looks and functions. If you want your products to be visible from the outside, we can craft large clear gable boxes or add a clear film window to kraft gable boxes. We provide unlimited customization options, such as matte, high-gloss, or metallic finishes. No matter what size your products are, we can adjust the dimensions to build the perfect box layout for your inventory. Here are the customization options that we provide. You can choose the style based on your brand guide, product needs, or personal preferences.\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "- Offset Lithography\n- Digital Printing\n- Flexography\n- Matte Coating/Lamination\n- Gloss Coating/Lamination\n- Soft-Touch Lamination\n- Hot Foil Stamping\n- Cold Foil Stamping\n- Metallic Inks\n- Spot UV Coating\n- Embossing & Debossing\n- Textured Finishes\n- Die-Cutting\n- Mounting/Twinned Walls\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": " Eco-Friendly Gable Packaging for US Consumers\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Modern shoppers in the US favor businesses that care about the environment. Our custom large gable boxes wholesale are made from sustainable, 100% recycled and recyclable paper fibers. They are completely biodegradable and compostable, helping your brand reduce its plastic waste. Rather than traditional plastic bags or paper bags, it's time to shift towards paper gable boxes with built-in handles. You show your customers that your brand stands for sustainability.\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": " How To Assemble Large Gable Boxes?\n",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Our oversized containers are engineered for maximum convenience. We ship your gable boxes wholesale order completely flat to save you valuable storage space in your warehouse. Assembling them is incredibly fast and requires no tape, glue, or staples:\n",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "- Step 1: Pop open the sides\nGently press the flattened box to open up the main square compartment.\n- Step 2: Lock the bottom\nFold the bottom tabs inward. The semi-automatic design will lock the base securely in place.\n- Step 3: Bring the handles together\nFold the top panels inward so the two die-cut handle sections meet at the apex.\n- Step 4: Slide the tabs\nPull the side flaps over the handle loops to lock the roof completely shut.",
          "level": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": " Contact HOF Pack For High-Quality Custom Boxes with Fast Turnaround",
          "level": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stop settling for generic, oversized shipping mailer boxes that hide your brand identity. HOF Pack makes it simple and affordable to order custom gable boxes tailored exactly to your business. Contact our team at info@hofpack.com or call +1 (888) 429-4881 for a free consultation, wholesale pricing, and fast turnaround.",
          "level": "p"
        }
      ]
