          "body": "Customers expect fresh coffee every time they open a bag. The right coffee bean packaging bag helps preserve flavor, aroma, and quality from the day it's packed until the last cup is brewed. Strong packaging also protects coffee during shipping, storage, and retail display. Good packaging doesn't just keep coffee safe. It also helps customers trust your brand.\n",
